    "title": "COLUMN: Once a brother, always a brother - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Locked, Loaded Half-Cocked Doug Blough ,\n14 days ago I played golf today with brother Paul – he of the 3,000 mile bike ride against cancer in ’17 that got his cholesterol down to about 18. Paul’s been my brother for as long as I can remember, but this was the first time just he and I golfed together. A couple hackers, we were Slow and Slower and had to wave half the county through. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
